flowchart TB
    accTitle: Ticketless Enterprise conceptual support flow
    accDescr: Conceptual component map based on the author's resume, not verified repository code. Voice interactions and screen understanding feed a LangGraph support workflow. Enterprise retrieval supplies context. Human approval and structured verification precede closure. Model providers, storage and deployment are unspecified.

    User["Employee support request"]

    subgraph Inputs["Voice and screen context"]
        Voice["Speech recognition + WebSocket voice"]
        Screen["VLM / OCR screen understanding"]
    end

    subgraph Support["Support orchestration"]
        Graph["LangGraph workflow"]
        RAG["Enterprise RAG"]
        Proposal["Proposed resolution"]
    end

    subgraph Review["Human review and closure"]
        Approval["Human approval"]
        Verify["Structured verification"]
        Closed["Verified closure"]
    end

    User -->|"spoken request"| Voice
    User -->|"screen context"| Screen
    Voice -->|"recognized request"| Graph
    Screen -->|"screen observations"| Graph
    Graph <-->|"retrieve supporting knowledge"| RAG
    Graph -->|"support guidance"| Proposal
    Proposal -->|"review"| Approval
    Approval -->|"approved path"| Verify
    Verify -->|"outcome confirmed"| Closed
